is Terrorcon minions.","poster_path":"/bNoznz2CDSWbarJ1NuT0m6zU2SP.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[10759,16,10762],"popularity":14.0482,"first_air_date":"2004-01-09","softcore":false,"vote_average":6.8,"vote_count":21,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/A7zBjRDFh1TXG3Buhi55mmS1qSr.jpg","id":66558,"name":"Voltron: Legendary Defender","original_name":"Voltron: Legendary Defender","overview":"Five unlikely teenage heroes and their flying robot lions unite to form the megapowerful Voltron and defend the universe from evil.","poster_path":"/yWAGNuPuUWJT9gIQmGdZiTGJWzh.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765,10751],"popularity":19.5698,"first_air_date":"2016-06-10","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.282,"vote_count":154,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/y0khlDVRmi5h0ARCLNYHAHugDzG.jpg","id":63090,"name":"Transformers: Robots In Disguise","original_name":"Transformers: Robots In Disguise","overview":"Years after the events of Predacons Rising, Bumblebee is summoned back to Earth to battle several of Cybertron's most wanted Decepticons that escaped from a crashed prison ship and assembles a team of young Autobots that includes Sideswipe (a rebel \"bad boy bot\"), Strongarm (an Elite Guard cadet), Grimlock (a bombastic Dinobot), and Fixit (a hyperactive Mini-Con with faulty wiring).","poster_path":"/pbRpKAGbXnASnNFHCGFC4CwVPla.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[10762,16,10759,10765],"popularity":30.3964,"first_air_date":"2015-03-14","softcore":false,"vote_average":7,"vote_count":58,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mCt3coepPkF6QlDQSO9tqI46yIV.jpg","id":68665,"name":"Big Hero 6 The Series","original_name":"Big Hero 6 The Series","overview":"Picking up immediately following the events in the feature film, these are the continuing adventures and friendship of 14-year-old tech genius Hiro and his compassionate, cutting-ed